message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Labels for packs of sheets by shipping order (db, 1999–2001)"
version: "1.0"
abstract: "A small application for the shipping department of a sheet producer. For each order the operator enters type, finish, format, colour, thickness, weight, number of sheets and pack number; the program prints one label per pack and keeps a log of the printed labels, which can be searched and reprinted."
